01:27.610 --> 01:29.150
langsung menghubungi Pak Kong.

01:29.150 --> 01:30.550
Anda juga tidak berdaya.

01:31.350 --> 01:32.810
Memang agak disayangkan.

01:36.070 --> 01:37.400
Terima kasih, Bu Fang.

01:38.070 --> 01:39.680
Kalau begitu cepatlah Anda kembali.

01:39.680 --> 01:41.680
